Z||000000||btoth||10-11-2001||03:55 PM||||OK, so some of you read about my ABM Treaty debate that I have to do in my politcal science class.  Well, the 5-page report is due Wednesday and it's a group project.  Four people devide up into pairs and each pair takes a side on the issue... my partner and I have the con side.  No big deal, except that my partner sucks.  <P>We've had since Sept. 7th to do this.  Now, I admit, I procrastinate with everything... but not like this girl... no, she's got to be the worst.  For the first three weeks I've been asking her when she plans on getting together to get this paper done... "don't worry it'll get done".  Ok.  That's great and all, but IT'S A GROUP PROJECT!!!  So last weekend I got tons and tons of resourses, magazines, foreign affairs journals, newpaper articles, congress debates, <I>everything</I> I could find.  I got all the good points and good quotes copied down so that I could just start putting the together (which I did)... now the paper is basically done... I can't let my GPA drop because some stupid freshman know-it all won't get her act together.  Anyway, I was feeling good knowing that no matter what happens, at least I got the paper done... so I call her up today just so that I tell her that I did it <I>all</I> already and thanks for the help.  (Yes, I'm a sarcastic bastard.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) So she answers the phone.. half asleep, it was almost 1:00pm!!! She said she'd call me back after she wakes up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  She called me just now, and guess what - she's just <I>full</I> of excuses... at first I asked when she planned on getting this done, it's due wednesday.  "Oh don't worry, I know what I'm doing, it will get done, I took a debate class last year, I'm good at this stuff, I'll dedicate a whole day to it and get it done...." this went on for a while.  I couldn't even get a word in.  When she finally shut up, I just said... it's basically all done, I just have to put the finishing touches on the paper, I have more than enough information, there's nothing for you to do, I just want to get together so that we're on the same page as far as what we're going to discuss in class. She said, "don't worry, it'll get done... I'll know what you know and more... let's get to gether Tuesday..."  WTF?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> It's due Wednesday d@mnit!  Obviously I have no confidence in this idiot whatsoever.  I do have a life, I like to get things done with, this is midterm month, I don't want to stress myself out over some moron that doesn't give a crap.  I swear, I'm finishing this paper and turning it in before it's due and I'm getting the credit for it!!! I would've just told her that - I couldn't care less about what she thinks of me - but she's one of those fast talkers that just won't shut the #%(@@!! up!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Ah.  I feel better now.... thanks.||||reg||8
