Z||000008||btoth||10-12-2001||03:46 PM||||Hahaha.  Yeah, I would be pissed too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Talked to her today... explained that we only need to do one paper.. not two.  I figured she must have been confused.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  Sure enough, all this time she thought we both had to write our <I>own</I> papers.  (Even though this is clearly stated in the instructions for the assignment.)  At least now she understands and now feels bad that she hasn't helped me out.<P>Oh well... seems things worked out.  A bit.<P>The deadline for our report has also been extended a week.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
